# mcp-tee env allowlist — github plugin (github 1.12.0 + @agiterra/github-tools v1.10.0 + wire-tools v2.0.0).
# Base set (PATH HOME USER LOGNAME SHELL LANG LC_* TERM TMPDIR TZ) is implicit.
# ENG-5158. Built from a static read of server.ts + node_modules/@agiterra/* (tests excluded) on 2026-10-21,
# plus the two subprocesses github-tools runs: `bash -c $GITHUB_APP_TOKEN_CMD` (gh-app-token.sh) and
# `gh auth token` (gh-shim). WIRE_* is listed by name so WIRE_DASHBOARD_TOKEN (operator-only) stays out.
AGENT_ID                 # Wire identity
AGENT_NAME
AGENT_PLAN
AGENT_PRIVATE_KEY        # signing
CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID   # session binding
WIRE_URL
WIRE_EXTERNAL_URL        # webhook callback base
GITHUB_TOOLS_STATE_DIR   # webhook registry location
GITHUB_TOKEN             # static-token path (this server's own credential)
GITHUB_APP_TOKEN_CMD     # mint path; Claude lanes set it
GITHUB_APP_*             # gh-app-token.sh: GITHUB_APP_ID GITHUB_APP_KEY_PATH (a key PATH, never a key value)
GH_*                     # gh-app-token.sh GH_APP_*; gh-shim GH_APP_TOKEN_CMD GH_APP_TOKEN_CACHE; gh GH_TOKEN GH_CONFIG_DIR
CURL_MAX_TIME            # gh-app-token.sh
XDG_CONFIG_HOME          # gh config location
